<heading>find - Find topics by name.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  find TEXT
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Finds topics whose name contains TEXT (case-insensitive
substring match). Results show the topic's category so that
identical or similar topic names stay understandable. No
ranking, no fuzzy matching.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
find empire
  Find topics containing 'empire'.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
list, add
</paragraph>
